 *
 * Wiring:
 *   BH1750 SDA  → GPIO2  (I2C bus 1 SDA)
 *   BH1750 SCL  → GPIO3  (I2C bus 1 SCL)
 *   BH1750 VCC  → 3.3 V
 *   BH1750 GND  → GND
 *   WS2812B DIN → GPIO18 (BCM 18, PCM_CLK)
 *   WS2812B VCC → 5 V (use external 5 V supply; Pi 4 3.3 V is insufficient)
 *   WS2812B GND → GND
