/*
 * Raspberry Pi 28BYJ-48 stepper motor control via L293D H-bridge.
 *
 * Buttons (active-LOW, internal pull-up):
 *   LOCK  -> GPIO23 (BCM)
 *   UNLOCK -> GPIO24 (BCM)
 *
 * Stepper coils (L293D IN1..IN4):
 *   IN1 -> GPIO17 (BCM)
 *   IN2 -> GPIO18 (BCM)
 *   IN3 -> GPIO27 (BCM)
 *   IN4 -> GPIO22 (BCM)
 *
 * Full-step two-phase drive: four-step sequence, 2 ms inter-step delay.
 * 512 steps = 1/8 turn (quarter turn).
 *
